meta-analysis of seven randomized clinical trials and nine observational studies</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>2005</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>8606</fpage><lpage>8612</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16260694</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1200/JCO.2005.02.7045</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>